<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>LinkedIn Optimizer - Land Junior ML/Data Science Roles</title>
<style>
:root {
  --primary: #2563eb;
  --primary-light: #3b82f6;
  --secondary: #7c3aed;
  --accent: #06b6d4;
  --success: #10b981;
  --warning: #f59e0b;
  --danger: #ef4444;
  
  --bg-dark: #0f172a;
  --bg-darker: #0a0e27;
  --bg-card: #1e293b;
  --bg-input: #1a2641;
  
  --text-primary: #f1f5f9;
  --text-secondary: #cbd5e1;
  --text-muted: #94a3b8;
  
  --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html, body {
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-dark) 0%, var(--bg-darker) 100%);
  color: var(--text-primary);
  min-height: 100vh;
  background-attachment: fixed;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

body { padding: 0; }

#app {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

/* HEADER */
.header {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37,99,235,0.15), rgba(124,58,237,0.08));
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 24px 20px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
}

.header-left h1 {
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: 700;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  background-clip: text;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.header-subtitle {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

.header-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
}

.btn-header {
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  padding: 8px 16px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.btn-header:hover {
  border-color: var(--primary);
  color: var(--primary);
}

/* CONTAINER */
.container {
  flex: 1;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 40px 20px;
}

/* TABS */
.tabs {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  overflow-x: auto;
}

.tab-btn {
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  padding: 12px 16px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
  border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.tab-btn:hover { color: var(--text-primary); }
.tab-btn.active {
  color: var(--primary);
  border-bottom-color: var(--primary);
}

/* SECTIONS */
.section {
  display: none;
  animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
}

.section.active { display: block; }

@keyframes fadeIn {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

/* CARDS & GRIDS */
.card {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 20px;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.card:hover {
  border-color: var(--primary);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
}

.card-title {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.grid-2 {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  gap: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

/* SCORE CARDS */
.score-card {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37,99,235,0.1), rgba(124,58,237,0.05));
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.score-header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.score-label {
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

.score-badge {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  background-clip: text;
}

.score-text {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.5;
}

/* BEFORE/AFTER */
.comparison-row {
  background: var(--bg-input);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.comparison-row h4 {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

.before-section {
  background: rgba(239,68,68,0.08);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--danger);
  padding: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

.after-section {
  background: rgba(16,185,129,0.08);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--success);
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

.before-label, .after-label {
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.before-label { color: var(--danger); }
.after-label { color: var(--success); }

.before-text, .after-text {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.5;
}

/* ROAST SECTION */
.roast-box {
  background: rgba(239,68,68,0.08);
  border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.3);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.roast-problem {
  color: var(--danger);
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-size: 12px;
}

.roast-text {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.roast-quote {
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--danger);
  padding: 12px;
  margin: 8px 0;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

/* ACTION ITEMS */
.action-week {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
}

.action-week-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.week-badge {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
  width: 56px;
  height: 56px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 20px;
  color: white;
}

.action-week-title {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

.action-item {
  background: rgba(37,99,235,0.05);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
  padding: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
}

.action-item strong {
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

/* CHECKBOXES */
.checkbox-list {
  list-style: none;
}

.checkbox-list li {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 8px 0;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
}

.checkbox-list input[type="checkbox"] {
  margin-top: 2px;
  cursor: pointer;
}

/* COPY BOX */
.copy-box {
  background: var(--bg-input);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
  line-height: 1.6;
  position: relative;
  max-height: 200px;
  overflow-y: auto;
}

.copy-button {
  position: absolute;
  top: 12px;
  right: 12px;
  background: var(--primary);
  color: white;
  border: none;
  padding: 6px 12px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.copy-button:hover {
  background: var(--primary-light);
}

/* BUTTONS */
.btn {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));
  color: white;
  border: none;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 13px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

.btn:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
}

/* LISTS */
.content-list {
  list-style: none;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.content-list li {
  padding: 8px 0;
  padding-left: 24px;
  position: relative;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
}

.content-list li:before {
  content: "→";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  color: var(--primary);
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* UTILITIES */
.mb-24 { margin-bottom: 24px; }
.mt-24 { margin-top: 24px; }
.text-center { text-align: center; }

h2 {
  font-size: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

h3 {
  font-size: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  margin-top: 20px;
}

/* TABLE */
.table-container {
  overflow-x: auto;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 8px;
}

.table th {
  background: var(--bg-input);
  color: var(--primary);
  padding: 12px;
  text-align: left;
  font-weight: 700;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
  font-size: 12px;
}

.table td {
  padding: 12px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
}

.table tr:hover {
  background: rgba(37,99,235,0.05);
}

/* RESPONSIVE */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .container { padding: 20px 12px; }
  .header { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .tabs { gap: 8px; }
  .tab-btn { padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 11px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="app">
  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-left">
      <h1>🎯 LinkedIn Optimizer for ML/Data Science Jobs</h1>
      <div class="header-subtitle">Land Junior-Level Roles • 30-Day Job Search Activation Plan</div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <button class="btn-header" onclick="printProfile()">📄 Print</button>
      <button class="btn-header" onclick="exportGuide()">💾 Export</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MAIN CONTAINER -->
  <div class="container">
    <!-- TABS -->
    <div class="tabs">
      <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab('roast')">🔥 The Roast</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('rebuild')">🏗️ The Rebuild</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('scorecard')">📊 Before/After</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('jobsearch')">💼 Job Search Plan</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('keywords')">🔍 Keywords & Tips</button>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================
         THE ROAST TAB
         ============================================ -->
    <div id="roast" class="section active">
      <h2>🔥 The Roast: Why Recruiters Skip Your Profile</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 24px;">Real talk: Your profile is optimized for network growth, not hiring. Here's what's actually hurting you in job search.</p>

      <!-- HEADLINE ROAST -->
      <div class="roast-box">
        <div class="roast-problem">❌ HEADLINE — 3.5/10 — "Signals collaboration, not job-readiness"</div>
        <div class="roast-text">
          <strong>Current headline:</strong>
          <div class="roast-quote">"ML Engineer Building & Deploying Production AI | Collaborating on Computer Vision & NLP | Let's Create Together"</div>
          
          <p style="margin-top: 12px;"><strong>The Problem for Job Search:</strong> "Let's Create Together" signals you want to build side projects, not take a job. Recruiters searching for "Junior Data Scientist" or "Machine Learning Engineer" on LinkedIn want someone HUNGRY for employment, not someone treating work as optional collaboration.</p>
          
          <p style="margin-top: 8px;"><strong>Why it hurts:</strong> Recruiters are busy. They scan 100+ profiles per day. Your headline doesn't immediately scream "hire me." It says "I'm cool and collaborative" — which is nice but doesn't convert to job offers.</p>
          
          <p style="margin-top: 8px;"><strong>Invisible cost:</strong> You're not showing up in recruiter searches. Keywords are weak for job market. You're not positioning yourself as job-ready.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ABOUT ROAST -->
      <div class="roast-box">
        <div class="roast-problem">❌ ABOUT SECTION — 4/10 — "Positioned for collaboration, not hiring"</div>
        <div class="roast-text">
          <strong>Problem:</strong> Your About section says "looking for collaborators" when recruiters want to see "actively seeking junior ML/Data Science role."
          
          <p style="margin-top: 12px;"><strong>Specific issues:</strong></p>
          <ul style="list-style: none; margin-left: 0;">
            <li style="padding: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--danger);">✗</span> No mention of job titles you're targeting</li>
            <li style="padding: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--danger);">✗</span> Says "collaborators building AI solutions" instead of "companies hiring Data Scientists"</li>
            <li style="padding: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--danger);">✗</span> No availability info (when can you start?)</li>
            <li style="padding: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--danger);">✗</span> CTA is vague ("message me about projects") — should be clear about job search</li>
          </ul>

          <p style="margin-top: 12px;"><strong>Why it hurts:</strong> Recruiters use keyword filters to find candidates. Your About section doesn't hit the keywords they search for: "actively seeking," "open to opportunities," "hiring," etc.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- EXPERIENCE ROAST -->
      <div class="roast-box">
        <div class="roast-problem">❌ EXPERIENCE — 4/10 — "Only one internship, no career progression"</div>
        <div class="roast-text">
          <strong>Current:</strong>
          <div class="roast-quote">ML Intern | Hexsoftwares Pvt Ltd | 3 months | Built sentiment analysis, stock prediction, Alzheimer's diagnostic models</div>
          
          <p style="margin-top: 12px;"><strong>The Problem:</strong> One internship at a startup doesn't prove you can do the job long-term. Recruiters want to see:</p>
          <ul style="list-style: none; margin-left: 0;">
            <li style="padding: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--danger);">✗</span> Ability to work on a team (internship might've been solo work)</li>
            <li style="padding: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--danger);">✗</span> Experience shipping code to production</li>
            <li style="padding: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--danger);">✗</span> Evidence of growth and learning</li>
          </ul>

          <p style="margin-top: 12px;"><strong>Why it hurts:</strong> Junior role requires proving you can execute in a business context, not just build projects. One internship isn't enough credibility.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- SKILLS ROAST -->
      <div class="roast-box">
        <div class="roast-problem">❌ SKILLS — 6/10 — "Missing critical job-search keywords"</div>
        <div class="roast-text">
          <strong>Current top skills:</strong> Machine Learning • Python • Deep Learning • Computer Vision • PyTorch
          
          <p style="margin-top: 12px;"><strong>Missing:</strong></p>
          <ul style="list-style: none; margin-left: 0;">
            <li style="padding: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--danger);">✗</span> "Data Science" (recruiters search for this term)</li>
            <li style="padding: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--danger);">✗</span> "SQL" (almost every junior data science role needs this)</li>
            <li style="padding: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--danger);">✗</span> "Pandas" (core data manipulation library)</li>
            <li style="padding: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--danger);">✗</span> "Scikit-learn" (standard for ML)</li>
            <li style="padding: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--danger);">✗</span> "Data Analysis" (job posting keyword)</li>
            <li style="padding: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--danger);">✗</span> "Statistics" (required for many roles)</li>
          </ul>

          <p style="margin-top: 12px;"><strong>Why it hurts:</strong> You're invisible for recruiter searches. They search for "SQL" or "Data Analysis" — you don't show up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- OVERALL SCORE -->
      <div class="score-card">
        <div class="score-header">
          <div class="score-label">📊 OVERALL PROFILE STRENGTH (FOR JOB SEARCH)</div>
          <div class="score-badge">22/100</div>
        </div>
        <div class="score-text">
          Your profile is actively HURTING your job search. You're positioned for collaboration/network, not employment. Recruiters don't see you as job-ready. To land a junior ML/DS role, you need to shift from "open to collaborations" to "actively seeking role" messaging.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="background: rgba(245,158,11,0.08); border-left: 3px solid var(--warning); padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 20px;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">
          <strong style="color: var(--warning);">⚠️ KEY INSIGHT:</strong> Your collaboration-focused profile will REPEL many recruiters because it signals you're not serious about getting hired. They'll skip you for someone who's clearly hungry for the role. Let's fix that.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================
         THE REBUILD TAB
         ============================================ -->
    <div id="rebuild" class="section">
      <h2>🏗️ The Rebuild: Optimized for Junior ML/Data Science Jobs</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 24px;">Here's how to reposition your profile to land junior-level roles.</p>

      <!-- HEADLINE REBUILD -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">📝 Headline — 3 Strategic Options</div>
        
        <div style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <h4 style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">OPTION 1: Job-Focused (RECOMMENDED)</h4>
          <div class="copy-box">
Junior Machine Learning Engineer | Data Science • Python • PyTorch | Actively Seeking Roles | Built 3+ Production AI Models
            <button class="copy-button" onclick="copyToClipboard(this)">COPY</button>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px;"><strong>Why this works:</strong> "Actively Seeking Roles" signals job-readiness. Lists keywords recruiters search for (ML, Python, PyTorch, Data Science). Proof you've built things. Searchable for junior roles.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <h4 style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">OPTION 2: Impact-Focused</h4>
          <div class="copy-box">
ML E
